AI-SDLC ops engine: plan, track and prototype from any AI coding harness

Usage: ehai [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  doctor    Check that ehai and its environment are healthy
  init      Guided setup: detect your tools, ask a few questions, wire everything up
  repo      Repo onboarding
  adapters  Manage harness integrations (Claude Code, ...)
  mcp       Run the MCP server on stdio (started by your AI harness, not by hand)
  config    Inspect configuration
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -y, --yes            Accept defaults for every question (non-interactive)
      --config <FILE>  Extra config file, applied above global and repo config
  -v, --verbose...     More logging on stderr (-v info, -vv debug, -vvv trace)
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
